# Shell scripts executed inside Linux containers/CI must keep LF endings.
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true converts them to CRLF on Windows checkout and the
# container fails with a shebang error. Applies to every repository that ships one.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
mvnw text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf